WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A film photographer frustrated with presenting his work on the web

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The homepage zoom highlights the grain of film and texture of paper

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Intentionally paced portfolios allow visitors to sit with the work calmly

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:52.000
A simple Stripe Checkout integration enables limited edition book sales
